{"schema_version":"1.7.5","id":"SUSE-SU-2025:4398-1","published":"2025-12-15T11:30:55Z","modified":"2026-03-23T04:51:31.357282Z","related":["CVE-2025-6075","CVE-2025-8291"],"upstream":["CVE-2025-6075","CVE-2025-8291"],"summary":"Security update for python3","details":"This update for python3 fixes the following issues:\n\nSecurity issues fixed:\n    \n- CVE-2025-6075: Fixed simple quadratic complexity vulnerabilities on `os.path.expandvars()` (bsc#1252974).\n- CVE-2025-8291: Fixed missing validity checks of the ZIP64 End of Central Directory (EOCD) (bsc#1251305).\n\nOther issues fixed:\n\n- Added @requires_lchmod operator for skipping tests on platforms were changing the mode of symbolic links is supported.\n- Fixed decoding byte strings in `localeconv()` for consistent output.\n","affected":[{"package":{"name":"python3","ecosystem":"SUSE:Linux Enterprise Server LTSS Extended Security 12 SP5","purl":"pkg:rpm/suse/python3&distro=SUSE%20Linux%20Enterprise%20Server%20LTSS%20Extended%20Security%2012%20SP5"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"3.4.10-25.163.1"}]}],"ecosystem_specific":{"binaries":[{"libpython3_4m1_0":"3.4.10-25.163.1","libpython3_4m1_0-32bit":"3.4.10-25.163.1","python3":"3.4.10-25.163.1","python3-base":"3.4.10-25.163.1","python3-curses":"3.4.10-25.163.1","python3-devel":"3.4.10-25.163.1","python3-tk":"3.4.10-25.163.1"}]},"database_specific":{"source":"https://ftp.suse.com/pub/projects/security/osv/SUSE-SU-2025:4398-1.json"}},{"package":{"name":"python3-base","ecosystem":"SUSE:Linux Enterprise Server LTSS Extended Security 12 SP5","purl":"pkg:rpm/suse/python3-base&distro=SUSE%20Linux%20Enterprise%20Server%20LTSS%20Extended%20Security%2012%20SP5"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"3.4.10-25.163.1"}]}],"ecosystem_specific":{"binaries":[{"libpython3_4m1_0":"3.4.10-25.163.1","libpython3_4m1_0-32bit":"3.4.10-25.163.1","python3":"3.4.10-25.163.1","python3-base":"3.4.10-25.163.1","python3-curses